  "name": "AIToggle",
  "description": "AIToggle is the canonical binary switch for AI surfaces. The ON state uses the AI brand color (#4D60E6); the OFF state uses a deliberately darker slate (#8D8A93) than DS border so the white thumb stays visible — meeting WCAG 1.4.11 (3:1 minimum) for non-text UI components. Pairs a label with the switch via labelPlacement (start/end/none), supports sm/md sizes, and exposes role=\"switch\" + aria-checked.",
